  "featured_image": "http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/eastondavis.jpg",
  "body_html": "<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/Gravity-Single-CD-Cover.jpg\"><img alt=\"Gravity Single CD Cover\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5712\" height=\"1500\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/Gravity-Single-CD-Cover.jpg\" width=\"1500\"/></a></p>\n<p>Warm up before the New Years Eve party with this vocal house track by award-winning Norwegian electronica artist Simon Field. For this groovy track Simon collaborates with London’er Easton Davis with credits from NTA Choir, sessions as a backing vocalist for George Michael, Queen, David Bowie and many others.</p>\n<p><iframe frameborder=\"no\" height=\"450\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/172154904&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false&amp;visual=true\" width=\"100%\"></iframe></p>\n<p>The music of Simon has been featured on various TV shows such as Californication, Ugly Betty, while he releases and produces music for Sony Music, Universal Music, Cosmos Music Group in Norway, US, Korea, Japan.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/eastondavis.jpg\"><img alt=\"eastondavis\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5711\" height=\"325\" src=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/12/eastondavis.jpg\" width=\"326\"/></a></p>\n<p>More about Mr. Field can be found on his <a href=\"http://www.simonfield.no/\">official website</a>, <a href=\"http://instagram.com/simonfieldofficial/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com:80/simon-field-with-a-new-vocal-house-track-gravity/www.soundcloud.com/simonfieldofficial\">Soundcloud</a>, <a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com:80/simon-field-with-a-new-vocal-house-track-gravity/www.facebook.com/simonfieldofficial\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"http://www.flowersinagun.com:80/simon-field-with-a-new-vocal-house-track-gravity/www.twitter.com/simonfieldmusic\">Twitter </a> &amp; <a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/user/homebrewprod\">YouTube.</a></p>\n<p>PS: Forgot to mention “Gravity” is also available in remixes by DJs Classi and Lars Van Dalen!</p>",
